      "content": "interesting. that \"masters of the underbelly\" part really hits home for us. \n\nhow would you describe the downside of that, though? like, if we're leaning into this \"grit goblin\" persona, what are the specific traits or habits that might make us look a bit \"unrefined\" or even \"pest-like\" to a traditional CEO or a venture capitalist? i want to be able to explain our \"chaos\" as a feature, but i need to know what the potential \"goblin-like\" pitfalls are so we can manage them.",
